{"bookInfo":{"bookId":"42000022184","bookName":"Tres vidas para cobrar venganza (Doblado)","cover":"https://thwztchapter.dramaboxdb.com/data/cppartner/4x2/42x0/420x0/42000022184/42000022184.jpg@w=360&h=640","viewCount":1514533,"followCount":28493,"introduction":"Yara Yáñez ama en secreto a su maestro Ciro, pero Xenia, su condiscípula envidiosa, revela su secreto. Ciro la expulsa del mundo inmortal y la condena a tres vidas de sufrimiento. Xenia le roba su hueso inmortal y sus poderes. Yara sufre humillaciones, pero su gata espiritual la protege. Al recuperar sus recuerdos, Yara planea su venganza. Regresa, recupera lo perdido y enfrenta a todos los traidores. Al final, Xenia y Ciro pagan por sus actos.","chapterCount":70,"labels":["Strong Female Lead","Revenge"],"tags":["Strong Female Lead","Revenge"],"typeTwoIds":[335],"typeTwoNames":["Venganza"],"typeTwoList":[{"id":335,"name":"Venganza","replaceName":"venganza"}],"language":"SPANISH","typeTwoName":"Venganza","simpleLanguage":"es","bookNameEn":"Tres-vidas-para-cobrar-venganza-Doblado","bookNameLower":"tres-vidas-para-cobrar-venganza-doblado","shelfTime":"2026-07-29 10:16:00","firstShelfTime":"2026-07-29 10:16:00","performerIdList":[]},"chapterList":[{"id":"701368918","index":0,"unlock":true,"mp4":"https://hwvideoseo.dramaboxdb.com/81/4x8/48x1/481x2/48122000024/701368918_1/701368918.720p.narrowv3.mp4?Expires=1795197600&Signature=g9XcAgZUxXEtic7-2RmGF0DxuvT0t9a~9S9nmjS2ekvcJtmx0xHVRoUEGrrVdjJnBzf-mAjoW7RlUsU2cIIHYTDIb-YiGZfG~O5fuwcQFG-joLbWIepQDAIHNyPnR9dMRny-oGYIwfL~bj8EhFlw1DqP0jHZVcRAEURFZF7WDs6SSFiNg0GgTwRdQAegV8xDSD9WxHtB~yYJZ6dn4nGIGsZnGghRZXuNvPnp7LhG3302s0yqeoK7vGwMEKvEVIJinOwEjvqI7bCFEInN0fr5JRMfW5V-AYEZprP0UwN0hd~wJ2a-19BLL8ZpZ6O-JLn4phP8Nrg4DoKgI9rxKUnD1Q__&Key-Pair-Id=K3HA2TLE2QH99V","cover":"https://thwztvideo.dramaboxdb.com/81/4x8/48x1/481x2/48122000024/701368918_1/701368918.mp4.jpg@w=100&h=135","duration":322441,"price":0},{"id":"701368919","index":1,"unlock":true,"mp4":"https://hwvideoseo.dramaboxdb.